  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Quotation and reformulation",
   "texto": [
    "**Et sitat** reproduces exact words; **en parafrase** expresses the idea with its own formulation. In both cases the source is indicated.",
    "**Etterprøvbar** means that other people can check the information."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Avoid plagiarism",
   "texto": [
    "A **kildehenvisning** points to where an idea comes from. To present other words or ideas as their own can be considered **plagiat**."
   ]
  },
